("site", "social", "https://worldwright.io/")
("site", "atlasDescription", "Seven imagined coastal learning stations in the Foreshore, Comparison Cove and Notebook Quay. Map artwork is retained Worldwright illustrative scenery, not coastal geography.")
("site", "accountNote", "An invented Tidepool Commons teaching story, not a personal account or real field measurement.")
